flowchart TB
    App[Application / principal boundary<br/>intent · success predicate · authority policy]

    subgraph Harness[Concurrent mediated Harness transition system]
        SE[State · evidence · events]
        Select[Select candidate transitions<br/>model · code · human · event]
        Mediate{Mediate boundaries}
        Validity[Validity<br/>evidence · candidate · postcondition]
        Authority[Authority<br/>principal · delegation · scope · audience]
        Apply[Apply / expose<br/>zero or more transitions]
        Outcome[Correlated outcome · error · cancellation]

        SE --> Select
        Select --> Mediate
        Validity --> Mediate
        Authority --> Mediate
        Mediate -->|allow / revise / reject / escalate / suspend| Apply
        Apply --> Outcome
        Outcome --> SE
    end

    App --> SE
    App --> Validity
    App --> Authority

    Infra[Infrastructure · tools · external world]
    Apply --> Infra
    Infra --> Outcome

    C3[Operational plane<br/>Cost · Compatibility · Continuity] -. varies current policy .-> Harness
    Cog[Cognition feedback plane<br/>experience → reusable policy delta] -. updates future policy .-> Harness
